notes.content:
[b]A major update from upgrade 2.0 is not working! [/b]

[i]It's noticed that you will notice the mechanics and art differences, but they aren't included yet and will be updated as soon as possible![/i]

Updates:
[list]
[*]New game mechanics for the player;

[*]Recreation of scenarios, to adapt to new player mechanics;

[*]Language: English and Portuguese;

[*]Adaptation for gamepads (partially);

[*]Menu system;

[*]Reworked the game arts;
[/list]

[h2] This major update will include: [/h2]

[list]
[*] Credits within the game menu;
[*] Create in the options menu and in main menu the volume and resolution of the game (full screen and window, 1920x1080, for example);
[*] Recreate the player's movement system;
[*] Readjust the quality of the characters' sprites;
[/list]

And much more! ...

[b] Stay tuned for more news, soon! [/b]
[i] Data expected to be updated: 06/25/2021. [/i]
